# Build context for the JVM services is `submodules/`. Keep only sources; drop
# generated artifacts, gradle caches and the modules that are never built from
# here, so the context transfer stays small. A module listed below cannot be
# built from THIS context at all (`COPY <module>` fails with "not found"), so
# the rule is: no module that compose builds from this context may appear here.
# A module with its OWN build context stays listed and still builds — gui and
# spatial-loader are built from ../submodules/gui and ../submodules/spatial-loader.
# content left the list in M4-02 and worker in M4-09, because their Dockerfiles
# build from here.
**/build
**/.gradle
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.git
gui
spatial-loader
